// A mole that drowns without having stood on dry ground nearby (here it starts sealed in a flooded chamber
// under a bedrock lid) still doesn't leave its pack under the water: it goes to the nearest dry floor within
// 16 m of where it died, the room above the lid. The log gives the cause first, then where the pack is.
// (Found by the polish playtest: seed 47514 drowned at 13 m with 14 of 16 piles in the water.)
map
BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB
#............................#
#............................#
#............................#
#............................#
######BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB#
######wwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwww#
######wwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwww#
######wwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwww#
######wwwwwwwwwwwww@wwwwwwwww#
##############################
end
mode survival
expect 2 deaths == 0
expect 1500 deaths >= 1
expect 1500 log:drowned == 1
expect 1500 log:on_dry_ground_near_where_you_fell == 1
// the pickaxe lies in the room above the lid (rows -5..-8 from the anchor), not in the chamber (rows -3..0)
expect 1500 items:Pickaxe == 1
expect 1500 iy:Pickaxe < -4
